<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{busy}}">正在处理…</view><view>新增和修改连接凭据暂不可用：服务端需先完成敏感请求日志保护。</view><button bindtap="load">刷新</button><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" class="card">{{item.name}}（{{item.id}}）<button wx:if="{{item.id !== '0'}}" size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button></view><view wx:if="{{!rows.length && !busy && !error}}">暂无记录</view></view>
